# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# anniversary — environment template
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored. Everything here is OPTIONAL: the app runs
# fully without a .env file. Copy this only if you want to turn
# the photo features back on.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Photo storage (S3-compatible) ──────────────────────────────
# Drives two features:
#   • /moments  — uploads a photo
#   • /memories — lists uploaded photos in the circular gallery
#
# Leave these unset and both pages stay readable: /memories shows its
# built-in sample gallery and /moments shows a "not connected" notice.
#
# The previous credentials pointed at a different project and were
# removed. Generate a fresh credential for THIS project's bucket and
# fill the values in below.
#
# ⚠️  Vite inlines only VITE_* into the browser bundle.
#     Do NOT put server-only secrets under a VITE_ prefix.

VITE_NEON_S3_ENDPOINT=
VITE_NEON_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
VITE_NEON_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
VITE_NEON_S3_REGION=us-east-2
VITE_NEON_S3_BUCKET=media
